Bi-Directional State Sync Trace:
1. User taps Switch in Flutter UI -> Sends command: {"led":"ON"} to topic: iot/esp32/control
2. ESP32 receives command -> Switches GPIO2 to HIGH
3. ESP32 publishes ACK to topic: iot/esp32/led_ack with payload: {"status":"ON"}
4. Flutter receives ACK -> Updates UI Switch color to Green.
Round-trip execution time: 14 ms. Zero state discrepancy.
